# Nested plans

Follow `docs/nested-plan-pattern.md`. A nested plan is a child of a location, not a peer of a hub.

- Add one only when sequence, ranking, or a mixed week would swamp the parent.
- Clone GOR, Queensland, or kayak visuals. Do not invent a fourth look.
- Keep `SiteNav` on the parent region and link back to the parent location.
- Do not copy Queensland’s on-page weekday clock onto `LocationPlanPage` stays.
